python EC2Thru.py /home/sisi/Project/adaptive/logs/<foldername> <N>
e.g., python EC2Thru.py /home/sisi/Project/adaptive/logs/N=4;LAN 4
Under the log folder, the names of the log files should be <B>.log where B is the batch size, e.g., 1.log, 10.log

For generating throughput values, uncomment the line with (#if printing throughput char, uncomment this)
For generating throughput vs lat chart, uncoment the line with (#if printing lat vs throughput chart, uncomment this)

This will generate the format for updating latex figures (need to change the order of the data a little bit)


